@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Active exam workspace (Views/ExamWindow, Services/Lockdown/LockdownCoordinator + ProcessGuardService +
' DeviceGuardService, Services/LiveMonitoringService: 10 s heartbeat timer + 1 s tick, ApplyProctorCommands,
' ApplyWebcamRequirement -> WebcamMonitorService; ReportViolation -> event spool -> POST
' /api/monitoring/events/batch, CaptureForViolation -> capture spool -> POST /api/monitoring/screenshot;
' MonitoringController pushes hub ViolationEvent / ScreenshotUploaded; ExamWindow.OnServerSessionStatus,
' ShowProctorWarnings, ApplyUnlockDeadline, ResyncRemaining).
' The three regions run independently (event-driven), so each has its own loop.
' Print sizing (D6): large font at dpi 96, so PlantUML's fixed pixel gaps stay small next to the text;
' printed size = 22 * (printed width in pt) / (PNG width px), at least 7 pt at the width used in Chapter 5.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  TitleFontSize 23
}

|Student|
|Desktop App|
|Server|
|Desktop App|
start
:Full-screen ExamWindow; LockdownCoordinator
starts keyboard, process, clipboard and USB
guards (not if lockdown Off); webcam
monitor if RequireWebcam;
fork
  |Student|
  repeat
    :Answer a
    question
    (auto-saved);
  repeat while (Session\nopen?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
fork again
  |Desktop App|
  repeat
    :Heartbeat every
    10 s (focus, camera
    status)>
    :Ack received<
    :Apply ack: resync
    timer, warning
    banner, pause or
    resume lockdown;
  repeat while (Session\nInProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no: ended])
fork again
  |Desktop App|
  repeat
    :Guard event<
    note right
      blocked key, clipboard,
      app not allowed, focus
      lost, USB storage, or
      webcam: NoFace, Multiple-
      Faces, LookingAway (head
      pose), PhoneDetected,
      Camera Covered/Frozen/
      Unavailable
    end note
    if (Enforce and
    app not allowed?) then ([yes])
      :Kill process
      (ProcessKilled);
    else ([no])
    endif
    :Event to events/batch,
    rate-limited screen
    capture (webcam issue:
    also a webcam snapshot)
    to /screenshot>
  repeat while (Session\nopen?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
fork again
  |Server|
  repeat
    :Heartbeat, event
    batch or capture<
    :MonitoringController
    stores it; a heartbeat
    gets an ack (remaining
    time, session status,
    extra time, up to 5
    warnings, unlock
    deadline);
    :Push "StudentHeartbeat",
    "ViolationEvent" or
    "ScreenshotUploaded"
    to the live monitor;
  repeat while (Session\nopen?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
  |Desktop App|
end fork
:Stop guards,
restore desktop;
stop
@enduml
